WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.458
Just go.

00:00:00.458 --> 00:00:01.710
No matter what your name is,

00:00:01.710 --> 00:00:03.420
everyone has something to protect.

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:05.046
I should’ve done this a long time ago.

00:00:05.046 --> 00:00:06.214
For Ellie Flaum,

00:00:06.214 --> 00:00:07.340
it's her freedom.

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:08.341
You’re laughing at me!

00:00:08.341 --> 00:00:09.592
Let me show you guys.

00:00:09.884 --> 00:00:10.760
it’s her flexibility.

00:00:11.553 --> 00:00:12.554
And it’s the life she’s been

00:00:12.554 --> 00:00:13.638
waiting to live in retirement.

00:00:14.472 --> 00:00:15.807
Am I smiling too much?

00:00:15.807 --> 00:00:17.600
Everyone has something to protect.

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:19.436
And Prudential can help guarantee

00:00:19.436 --> 00:00:20.520
income through retirement.

00:00:21.146 --> 00:00:22.605
So you can protect

00:00:22.605 --> 00:00:23.940
your life’s work.

00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:24.691
I did it!

00:00:24.691 --> 00:00:25.400
Thank you!

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:26.735
This is definitely not the last.

